OL,3,GNEWSACouncil fridge disposal suspended
OL,4,Aover backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tipping fears are mounting after
OL,7,Fanother council temporarily suspended
OL,8,Fthe disposal of fridges and freezers at
OL,9,Fits recycling centre.
OL,11,FNorth Tyneside Council has followed
OL,12,Fother local authorities across the UK
OL,13,Fin suspending the collections because
OL,14,Fof national capacity issues affecting
OL,15,Fthe safe and legal disposal of the
OL,16,Fappliances.
OL,18,FResidents in South Tyneside and County
OL,19,FDurham can still take fridges and
OL,20,Ffreezers to their local centres or
OL,21,Farrange a bulky waste collection.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
