OL,3,GNEWSACouncil fridge disposal suspended
OL,4,Aover backlog
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservative councillor Liam Bones has
OL,7,Fwritten to North Tyneside's elected
OL,8,FLabour mayor to raise concerns that the
OL,9,Fsuspension could lead to an increase in
OL,10,Fpeople dumping the white goods
OL,11,Fillegally. The council has apologised.
